WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.401
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:03.536
We hope you're doing well

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.070
and now, we're going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:08.541
President Biden said on Friday
that he is "convinced"

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:10.210
that Russian
President Vladimir Putin

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.012
has already made the decision
to invade Ukraine.

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:15.381
Putin reportedly made
the decision somewhere around

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:16.850
his ninth birthday.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.751
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:20.286
He was a fun kid.

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.488
[ Laughter ]
President Biden held a meeting

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:24.791
of the National Security Council
yesterday

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.826
to discuss the situation
in Ukraine,

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:28.895
where they told him
it's basically like

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:31.331
washing down Taco Bell
with an iced coffee --

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:33.566
we know something's going
to happen.

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:36.236
We just don't know when
and how bad.

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:38.404
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:41.173
It was announced yesterday
that Britain's Queen Elizabeth

00:00:41.173 --> 00:00:43.142
has tested positive
for the coronavirus.

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:46.112
Wow. You couldn't wait
just a few more weeks

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:47.213
to hit the club.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.883
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:52.251
The National Archives
confirmed last week

00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:54.320
that former President Trump
improperly took

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.189
classified material
from the White House

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:57.690
to his Mar-A-Lago club.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.026
Also, all the copper wiring.

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:01.861
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.596
Ahead of President Biden's State
of the Union address next week,

00:01:04.596 --> 00:01:07.166
authorities in Washington, D.C.
will reportedly put

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:09.302
additional fencing
around the Capitol,

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:11.337
which is actually all you need
to know

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:12.872
about the state of the union.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:14.206
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.206 --> 00:01:16.909
Rudy Giuliani is set to appear
in an upcoming episode

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:19.579
of the singing competition show
"The Masked Singer."

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:22.148
I knew that couldn't be
his real face.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:25.651
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.651 --> 00:01:28.154
Former President Trump
yesterday launched

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:30.723
his new social media app,
Truth Social.

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.492
It's expected to revolutionize

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:34.494
the way Americans
have their data stolen.

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:36.395
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.395 --> 00:01:38.397
According to a new survey,

00:01:38.397 --> 00:01:41.634
22% percent of Americans said
that they are very interested

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:44.436
in being president of the
United States for one day.

00:01:44.436 --> 00:01:45.705
"When can you start?"

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:46.940
asked one man.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.374
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.809
"'Cause I'd love if somebody
would jump in today."

00:01:50.809 --> 00:01:52.912
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:56.382
A dog in California was recently
reunited with its family

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:58.650
after it was missing
for 12 years.

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:00.219
Or in the dog's mind,

00:02:00.219 --> 00:02:01.453
a couple hours.

00:02:01.453 --> 00:02:03.756
[ Laughter ]
"Everybody chill
the [bleep] out."

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:07.326
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.326 --> 00:02:09.028
"I went outside."

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:10.463
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.165
AT&amp;T is set tomorrow

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:14.634
to shut down
its 3G cellular network.

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:17.770
As opposed to their 4G network,
which shuts down whenever.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.939
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:21.741
And, finally,
an athlete from Finland

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:24.176
told reporters over the weekend
that, after competing

00:02:24.176 --> 00:02:26.779
in the men's 50-kilometer
cross-country ski race

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:28.047
at the Beijing Games,

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:30.450
his penis was
"a little bit frozen."

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:31.751
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:33.653
Though, just because he needed
an excuse

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:36.021
after he was caught
"warming it up."

00:02:36.021 --> 00:02:38.591
[ Laughter ]
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

